<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49512" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tūs</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">thūs</span></b> ), tūris, n.
		from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύος, τό</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>incense</i>, <i>frankincense.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i><span class="en">Plin. 12,
				14, 30, § 51</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen.
				2, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Trin. 4, 2, 89</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Truc.
				2, 5, 27</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">accendere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 4, 35, § 77</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Off. 3, 20, 80</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Lucr. 3,
			327</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 11, 481</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. E. 8,
			65</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tib. 1, 3, 34</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 7, 53</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Prop. 3,
			10</span></i> (4, 9), 19; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 1, 30, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 36,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 1, 22</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">irrita tura tulit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					7, 589</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">centumque Sabaeo Ture calent arae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 1, 417</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. G. 1, 57</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Tug terrae, <i>a
			plant</i>, <i>called also</i> chamaepitys, <i><span class="en">Plin. 24, 6,
				20, § 29</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
